  "post_content": "<p>La sala La Cassola del Centro de Empleo y Cultura ha acogido la tarde de este martes la charla-coloquio C&oacute;mo vivir el presente con optimismo, organizada la Asociaci&oacute;n Adolor Onda dentro de los actos del Mes del Voluntarriado.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/12/DSC_00791.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 319px\" /></p>\n<p>La disertaci&oacute;n ha estado a cargo de &Aacute;ngel Enrique Roig, pisc&oacute;logo colaborador de IPSIC Cl&iacute;nica y Salud, que ha sido presentado por Estefan&iacute;a Ruiz Palomino, tambi&eacute;n psic&oacute;loga y directora de esta empresa.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaadolormesvoluntariatonda/dsc_0073.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0073\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaadolormesvoluntariatonda/dsc_0074.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0074\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaadolormesvoluntariatonda/dsc_0075.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0075\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaadolormesvoluntariatonda/dsc_0076.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0076\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaadolormesvoluntariatonda/dsc_0077.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0077\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaadolormesvoluntariatonda/dsc_0078.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0078\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaadolormesvoluntariatonda/dsc_0079.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0079\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaadolormesvoluntariatonda/dsc_0080.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0080\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaadolormesvoluntariatonda/dsc_0081.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0081\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaadolormesvoluntariatonda/dsc_0082.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0082\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaadolormesvoluntariatonda/dsc_0083.jpg\" alt=\"dsc_0083\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
